 "subs": [
  {
   "from": 0,
   "to": 47,
   "text": "Honestly, I don't know what to wear tonight."
  },
  {
   "from": 47,
   "to": 106,
   "text": "I want to be casual and simple."
  },
  {
   "from": 106,
   "to": 228,
   "text": "I love these jeans. They're from Zara, and lately I've been obsessed with them."
  },
  {
   "from": 228,
   "to": 294,
   "text": "And this is the belt I'm gonna use."
  },
  {
   "from": 294,
   "to": 369,
   "text": "It's been with me for decades."
  },
  {
   "from": 369,
   "to": 457,
   "text": "It's giving the seat belt in the airplane."
  },
  {
   "from": 457,
   "to": 596,
   "text": "And I have this long sleeve that I want to wear tonight. This is from a Russian brand."
  },
  {
   "from": 596,
   "to": 721,
   "text": "I really like the sleeves because they're giving the same vibe as the jeans."
  },
  {
   "from": 721,
   "to": 828,
   "text": "For the shoes, I'm gonna wear these boots. They're also from Zara."
  },
  {
   "from": 828,
   "to": 966,
   "text": "And now the hardest part is to choose which coat I want to wear."
  },
  {
   "from": 966,
   "to": 1094,
   "text": "I know that I have one coat that's gonna be very nice in this outfit,"
  },
  {
   "from": 1094,
   "to": 1211,
   "text": "but I don't want to wear it because I've been wearing this for the last week, non-stop."
  },
  {
   "from": 1211,
   "to": 1242,
   "text": "You see, it's nice."
  },
  {
   "from": 1242,
   "to": 1329,
   "text": "The first option is a leather jacket."
  },
  {
   "from": 1329,
   "to": 1358,
   "text": "Actually, it's not bad."
  },
  {
   "from": 1358,
   "to": 1420,
   "text": "This is another option with another leather jacket."
  },
  {
   "from": 1420,
   "to": 1501,
   "text": "I really like this washed brown color."
  },
  {
   "from": 1501,
   "to": 1617,
   "text": "Okay, the last one is a bit oversized black coat."
  },
  {
   "from": 1617,
   "to": 1726,
   "text": "I think it looks nice too, but I don't know if it's a vibe."
  },
  {
   "from": 1726,
   "to": 1775,
   "text": "I think we're ready!"
  },
  {
   "from": 1775,
   "to": 1948,
   "text": "I decided to go with this almost black leather jacket and this bag that I wanted."
  },
  {
   "from": 1948,
   "to": 2041,
   "text": "I made some messy hair. I have my favorite rings on."
  },
  {
   "from": 2041,
   "to": 2146,
   "text": "For the perfume, I decided to go with Kilian, A Taste of Heaven."
  },
  {
   "from": 2146,
   "to": 2227,
   "text": "I'm obsessed with heavy smells."
  },
  {
   "from": 2227,
   "to": 2295,
   "text": "Let me know, guys: what do you think about this look?"
  },
  {
   "from": 2295,
   "to": 2366,
   "text": "Bye! I'm gonna get drunk."
  }
 ]
